 "remarks": "67 Carter Street - Exceptional Modern Estate  Experience unrivaled luxury at this extraordinary 2.5-acre sanctuary in New Canaan. Encompassing nearly 7,300 sq ft above grade and an additional 2,000 sq ft in the lower level with soaring 10-foot ceilings, this architectural masterpiece offers a refined and expansive living experience. A chef's gourmet kitchen anchors the home, complemented by five luxurious bedrooms and seven designer bathrooms. The spectacular primary suite spans over 1,000 sq ft, featuring a spa-level bath reminiscent of a five-star resort. The third-floor office and library boast panoramic views, while striking fireplaces and fluid indoor-outdoor transitions elevate every room. The lower level doubles as a wellness retreat with space for a private gym and spa. An additional 2,000 sq ft of outbuildings opens the door to creative or recreational possibilities, whether studio, guest space, or workshop. Set high above neighboring homes, the estate commands sweeping treetop views and absolute seclusion. Despite its private feel, it remains conveniently close to New Canaan's premier shopping, dining, and schools.  Enjoy a New England arboretum atmosphere with walking trails, a tranquil koi pond, and multiple entertaining terraces across all levels-perfect for hosting or relaxation. This is more than a home-it's a one-of-a-kind estate where Gold Coast elegance meets modern sophistication. Designed for those who expect nothing less than perfection.",
